  "content": "<p>如需此模组的数据包版本，请点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</p>\n<p>为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a>添加了更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫乐事</a>切菜板配方</p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有木材类型的树皮获取、剥离和回收功能</li>\n<li>从单格高的花朵中获取更多染料</li>\n<li>玫瑰石英块可以分解为玫瑰石英碎块</li>\n<li>（最高支持 1.19.2）泥砖可以分解为泥砖块</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/rosequartzcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰石英切割\"></p>\n<p>想要将农夫切割系列整合为一个模组？请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">农夫切割合集</a></p>",
